{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56814","headline":"双礼珠弹云璈而答歌一章 · 项宗","name":"双礼珠弹云璈而答歌一章","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉清出九天，神馆飞霞外。\n霄台焕嵯峨，灵夏秀蔚翳。\n五云兴翠华，八风扇绿气。\n仰吟消魔咏，俯研智与慧。\n万真啓晨景，唱期绦房会。\n挺颖德音子，神映乃拂沛。\n天岳凌空构，洞台深幽邃。\n游海悟井隘，履真觉世秽。\n儛轮宴重空，筌鱼自然废。\n廻我大椿罗，长谢朝生世。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"项宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56814.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56814","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}